flowchart TD
  A[Operator in side browser<br/>confirm intended Moltbook agent] --> B[Terminal<br/>Keychain prompt]
  B --> C[MacOsKeychainSecretProvider]
  C --> D{Secret present?}
  D -- no --> X[FAIL CLOSED<br/>doctor reports missing secret]
  D -- yes --> E[MoltbookHttpClient<br/>GET only]
  E --> F{Origin exactly<br/>https://www.moltbook.com/api/v1?}
  F -- no --> X
  F -- yes --> G[Authorization: Bearer key<br/>redirect=error]
  G --> H[GET /posts?sort=new&limit&cursor]
  H --> I[GET /posts/:id]
  I --> J[GET /posts/:id/comments]
  J --> K[Validate envelope + timestamps<br/>drop deleted/spam]
  K --> L[Normalize post/context<br/>ConfiguredMoltbookSource filters]
  L --> M[Sol orchestration<br/>fixture or live-read dry-run]
  H -. 429/5xx/timeout .-> N[Bounded status-aware retry]
  N --> H
  H -. 401/403/malformed/redirect .-> X
